{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/161473-a-slight-shift-in-emphasis-aliens","id":161473,"title":"A slight shift in emphasis - aliens","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-07T00:53:20-07:00","id":161473,"title":"A slight shift in emphasis - aliens","content":"Thinking about a different take on the Changeling setting.<br /> <br /> Changelings are captured by beings that cannot be described as terrestrial. Invasive physiological and psychological procedures happen. The abductees find some way of returning to Earth, but find themselves irrevocably changed by their experiences. Their life has been taken over by a replicant constructed from raw materials by their abductors.<br /> <br /> The abductees now have abilities that go beyond the human experience - psionics, tapping into the human subconscious (&quot;dreamwalking&quot;), adjusting &quot;destiny&quot; (a simple force of nature that underlies all of physical existence), molecular change, that sort of thing.<br /> <br /> There is a society of people who share similar experiences and have been similarly changed. Few find it easy to trust each other - you never know if your peers are on your side, or working for the aliens.<br /> <br /> (I know there's already some of that in the official game. I'd like to emphasize on these particular parts a little more).<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T02:29:11-07:00","id":161511,"title":"","content":"Pledges are an extension of the idea of there being some sort of massive force underlying all of existence that an unscientific mind may call &quot;destiny&quot;. Contracts are simple understanding of some of the rules of reality, and how to exploit them. The Hedge is an unexplained something that's kinda sorta between the &quot;collective unconsciousness&quot; of the dreamscape that changelings walk every now and then, and the alien homelands of the Visitors.<br /> <br /> Beasts are totally artificially created human/animal chimera.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-08T13:50:20-07:00","id":162671,"title":"","content":"Fetches are pod people and changelings are Manchurian candidates for the Great Arcadian Invasion!<br /> <br /> The Wyrd is actually a complex network of nanites that has been seeded throughout the cosmos by the Arcadian Civilization that harnesses the chaotic, ambient energies of the Hedge Dimension! During their Durance, the molecular composition of changelings is suffused with &quot;Contract&quot; nanites that unlock specific reality warping protocols from the seeded nanites. As their &quot;Wyrd&quot; increases, changelings gain greater control of these microscopic, nigh ubiquitous machines.<br /> <br /> For some reason, Iron is incredibly corrosive to these Arcadian &quot;Wyrd&quot; nanites, causing the machines to malfunction and decay at an accelerated rate. Maybe the Arcadian home world doesn't have iron as a prevalent element, and the building blocks of their entire infrastructure is chemically incompatible with the element. *hand waves* CUZ SCIENCE","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","name":"Firefly Night","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-26T06:51:55-07:00","id":292942,"title":"","content":"For a twist, there may be Changeling aliens, if there are Keepers who abduct sentient creatures from worlds other than Earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T10:29:45-07:00","id":293886,"title":"","content":"I don't think it takes too much work - one glimpse-through at crystallinks or listening to some of the stories about what is supposed to happen at Dulce (like aliens soaking in vats of human organs, blood, and bile like it was a hot tub) reveals that &quot;aliens&quot; have about as much to do with actual science as Hedge stuff does. In particular - astral travels to other dimensions, energy vortexes that open to other worlds and channel energy of strong emotions, and so on - are very much part of UFO lore and mythology, and literally take next to no conversion. Once you start getting into third and fourth kind stories, they start to get -very- dreamy, faelike, and just downright bizarre.<br /> <br /> Betty Hill reported she was shown a room in which a bird caught fire, fell apart into odd pieces of clockwork, and the clockwork pieces began transforming into worms which crawled back into a bird.<br /> <br /> There are drugs in which &quot;alien&quot; figures are supposed to contact and &quot;scan&quot; users.<br /> <br /> I personally knew a guy who claimed aliens told him that a particular dried mix of certain mushroom species and canabis allowed him to open portals into an &quot;astral dimension&quot; full of thorny branches and that he fought &quot;alien demons&quot; in person there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T10:47:17-07:00","id":293902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There are drugs in which &quot;alien&quot; figures are supposed to contact and &quot;scan&quot; users. </div> </div> </div>DMT &lt;3 I should try once and say hello to mechanical elves.<br /> <br /> Also this for alien themed Changeling:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1JIa6ZhD0zk\" data-code=\"1JIa6ZhD0zk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"vid